{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37142","headline":"艺堂 · 郑损","name":"艺堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂开冻石千年翠，艺讲秋胶百步威。\n揖让未能忘典礼，英雄孰不惯戎衣。\n风波险似金机骇，日月忙如雪羽飞。\n莫怪尊前频浩叹，男儿志愿与时违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}